<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Official Bioware DLC causes a few minor bugs in standalone campaigns.
</p><p>It appears that certain resources which should only extend the OC behave like core resources.   
</p><p>This isn't necessarily a complete list. Please add any you discover.
</p>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Stone_Prisoner">Stone Prisoner</span></h3>
<pre>* Codex entry for character Shale appears as a blank which can never be completed.
* rewards M2DA overrides certain lines (10000 and 10100 for sure, possibly others). 
</pre>
