<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Workarounds">Workarounds</span></h2>
<p>These bugs don't occur when the DLC in question is disabled. Players might be reluctant to accept that solution, of course.
</p><p>Spurious codex entries could be suppressed if we had access to the DLC plot files. Unfortunately they are encrypted, so we just have to live with it. 
</p><p>2DA row ID issues can be avoided by using a very high range (even in a standalone campaign table that's intended to replace the OC).
</p>
